<Legal
  title="Privacy Policy | englishtoburmese.com"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  updated="27 October 2026"
  description="Privacy Policy for englishtoburmese.com. Discover how we protect your privacy and handle text, voice, and uploaded documents safely during translation."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <p>
    At <strong>englishtoburmese.com</strong>, we are committed to respecting and protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines how your data is handled when you use our <a href="/">English to Burmese translation tool</a>, upload documents, or get in touch with us.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Information we handle</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Translation inputs:</strong> English text, audio recordings made through the "Talk" function, and uploaded documents (.txt, .docx, .pdf) provided for conversion into Burmese.</li>
    <li><strong>Communications:</strong> Your name, email address, and message content when submitting queries via our <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical telemetry:</strong> Anonymized server logs including request timestamps, browser user-agent, and general geographic location (country-level) used exclusively for performance monitoring and DDoS prevention.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Ephemeral data processing</h2>
  <p>
    Text submissions and uploaded files are processed in-memory and transiently to return translations in real time. We do not maintain a permanent database of your translated sentences or document contents, and we never sell your data or license it to third-party ad brokers.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Third-party translation services</h2>
  <p>
    In order to deliver machine translation and voice recognition, requests may be routed through secure, encrypted APIs operated by established machine learning providers. These providers process content strictly to return the requested translation payload.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Cookie policy</h2>
  <p>
    We do not use intrusive third-party advertising cookies, cross-site trackers, or behavioral profiling scripts. Minimal local browser storage may be utilized strictly to remember user preferences (such as your chosen tab between Text and File).
  </p>

  <h2>5. Security practices</h2>
  <p>
    All communication between your browser and our servers is secured with HTTPS and industry-standard TLS encryption, ensuring your inputs cannot be intercepted in transit.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Rights and contact</h2>
  <p>
    You have the right to inquire about data processing practices or request assistance regarding communications you have sent us. For privacy questions, please reach out via <a href="/contact">Contact us</a> or email <a href="mailto:hello@englishtoburmese.com">hello@englishtoburmese.com</a>. See also our <a href="/terms">Terms and Conditions</a> and <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
